  <section class='content-section'>
    <h2 class='section-heading-centered'>What You'll Learn at This Station</h2>

    <div class='intro-box'>
      <p><strong>HAP's Discovery:</strong> I thought if statements were all the same. Then I learned there are three different structures — and picking the right one makes your code clearer and prevents bugs. The key is understanding when you need ONE path chosen from many.</p>
